were vampires who tried to overflow certain lands with thralls. Yet he appeared before them, condemned their act, and left."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was a blaze. There were vampires who pulled the strings of certain countries from the shadows and indulged in luxury. Yet he overthrew them and vanished in the darkness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He was a lightning. There were vampires who dyed a certain castle in the blood of young maidens every night. Yet he appeared and put an end to their madness along with them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A merciless god, appearing from nowhere to bring a judgement for those who are haughty with immortal lives, imagining themselves night overlords, and yielding souls to their desires.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from in-game narration"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15196"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/421cb0b946bd9270d2e2284913515517f25c04535bfad1258a18ccc10cf0d71c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7de2407e28bb6d78cd08c9cb3e852deb94853cab3fb129407722f6adce266d60.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"林檎畑 四十郎","creatorId":"vndb:s890","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s890","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s890","name":"西前忠久","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:33544","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p242","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:309","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p242","name":"light","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:14828:309","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p242","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p242","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p242","name":"light","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:13489:v5843",